title: "Türkiye Health Tourism Surge Capacity Simulator"
abstract: >-
  A province-level stochastic network simulation of how the health tourism
  infrastructure of Türkiye could meet care needs created by epidemics, natural
  disasters and armed conflict in other countries, from 2027 to 2047.
keywords:
  - health tourism
  - extraordinary situations
  - medical evacuation
  - rehabilitation
  - computer simulation
